[en.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_CRISIS_SELF]
I am the Crisis

[en.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_CRISIS_SELF_desc]
Sombra once tried to go it alone and failed, now, he doesn’t mind trying it again. The Windigos? No, only the Emperor of Shadows is the only true master of the sky, earth and sea of Equestria.

[zh.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_CRISIS_SELF]
我即灾厄

[zh.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_CRISIS_SELF_desc]
森布拉曾经尝试过单打独斗但失败了，现在，他不介意再尝试一次。风之魔？不，只有暗影之皇帝才是小马利亚天空、大地与海洋的唯一主宰。

